# 🏡 Carevora

### AI-Powered Personalized Wellness Monitoring and Early Risk Detection System for Elderly Care Homes

<p align="center">
  <b>J26-IT-421</b><br>
  B.Sc. (Hons) in Information Technology<br>
  Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (SLIIT)
</p>

---

## 🌿 About Carevora

**Carevora** is an AI-powered elderly-care support platform designed to assist caregivers in monitoring the **emotional, cognitive, and metabolic well-being** of elderly residents.

The platform combines:

- 🤖 Artificial Intelligence
- 🧠 Machine Learning
- 💬 AI-Assisted Conversational Assessment
- 📊 Personalized Risk Prediction
- 🔍 Explainable AI
- 💡 Personalized Recommendations
- 👩‍⚕️ Caregiver Decision Support

into a unified web-based elderly-care platform.

> **Important:** Carevora is an academic research and decision-support system.  
> It is **not a medical diagnostic system** and does not replace professional healthcare services.

